Cat Clip Composer 0.1.31

- Adds split undo/redo controls with selectable multi-step history destinations.
- Adds an About window with the Mr. Cat splash image and experiment/build details.
- Checks public GitHub metadata separately for newer source and downloadable Windows releases.
- Bounds, times out, caches, and cancellation-protects update requests without downloading files.
- Hardens trusted-link opening and reports invalid folder/browser launch failures instead of crashing.
- Completes dependency, analyzer, secret, process/path/network, XAML, build, and package audits.
